ad of fighting it — gives it its truth. The system going wrong is the engine; one breakable person is the heart. The fourth engineering taught me to hold both at full strength at once.\n\nBy the end of it I was ready. Not to pitch. To execute.","createdAt":"2026-06-02T05:24:07.040Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-02T05:55:45.759Z","_id":"w3Nyge9heN90NAZg"}
